{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/7339c20bdad07462d45f2c01cfb3d6f2.avif?t=1751460958\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BTGZ:FC</strong> is a multi-perspective horror experience inspired by the Backrooms. Discover the hidden truth behind the liminal levels through the eyes of different characters, from a remote-controlled drone exploring endless tunnels, to a lost survivor trying to escape, to a <strong>M.E.G</strong> team fighting to rescue others.<br>Each chapter offers a unique viewpoint, new gameplay mechanics, and deeper insight into the dark world buried within the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/5832b744323c629854ba0f5fa60abe0c.avif?t=1751460958\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short version:</strong> A group of scientists were experimenting with energy generation when they accidentally opened a portal to a non-stable liminal space, a place filled with hostile entities, radiation, and dangerous anomalies.  <br>After losing several members of the exploration team, they deployed a well-equipped remote-controlled drone to collect data, secure the area, and uncover the secrets hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/49e82578744add517bd9ca1276457589.avif?t=1751460958\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As mentioned before, each story will have its own unique gameplay mechanics and elements. However, some features may be shared across multiple chapters, especially when the stories are connected, part of a sequel, or involve recurring characters within the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One example is the<strong> Locator Device:</strong>\u00a0a tool created by <strong>M.E.G</strong>. with two main functions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scanner application:\u00a0</strong>Upload or capture transmissions floating in the ether, such as images, videos, audio, or text files.  <br>Captured transmissions are saved to your data log, allowing you to review them at any time: Listen to audio, watch videos, view images, or read discovered text files.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/995c1d37fbdf4ef4e8162d238e352ed7.poster.avif?t=1751460958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/995c1d37fbdf4ef4e8162d238e352ed7.webm?t=1751460958\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scanner settings application:</strong>\u00a0Detect specific items in the levels by selecting their material properties. You can filter by a single parameter or combine multiple ones to isolate a specific item.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/98774561b75f238fc0f4c9a9e3877ab8.poster.avif?t=1751460958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/98774561b75f238fc0f4c9a9e3877ab8.webm?t=1751460958\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, the Locator Device can interface with map devices. This allows certain entities or items to appear on your scanner and be marked directly on your map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/extras/f3a8db5d3a5dd84c88b4543b98f64574.avif?t=1751460958\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the initial release of the game, and it currently includes only one story: <strong>Dark Tunnels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More stories will be added as <strong>free updates</strong> in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still under active development, new features, mechanics, and stories will be added based on community feedback and suggestions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844760?t=1751460958","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844760?t=1751460958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/7b0d3830c0928d379a5cb123d7ac8f06671a5492/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751460958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844760/7b0d3830c0928d379a5cb123d7ac8f06671a5492/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751460958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: